        "Non-loanee farmers can apply through banks, PACS, Vasudha Kendras (CSCs), the National Crop Insurance Portal or the Krishi Rakshak Portal. One report says ICICI Lombard covers 21 North Bihar districts and AIC covers 17 South Bihar districts.",
